 "media": [
  {
   "mediaId": "1-3-intro-video",
   "kind": "video",
   "runtimePath": "lessons/1-3/media/1-3-intro-video.mp4",
   "sha256": "29ec09654dae4041c8840349191d8d0876b5622ff9ce2b8aefbdd1a4975db637",
   "durationSeconds": 238.144,
   "transcriptSource": "videos-project:lesson-1-3/assets/audio/captions.generated.ts",
   "narrationDurationSeconds": 218.1,
   "offsetSeconds": 10.0,
   "expectedDurationSeconds": 238.1,
   "offsetVerified": true,
   "offsetStatus": "verified",
   "cueCount": 46,
   "segments": [
    {
     "index": 0,
     "startSeconds": 10.0,
     "endSeconds": 24.03,
     "textPreview": "大家好，欢迎来到闲聊自控。自动舵上有一个增益旋钮，船还是那条船。把它拧大一点，修",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 1,
     "startSeconds": 24.45,
     "endSeconds": 33.25,
     "textPreview": "同一个结构，只改一个数字，行为为什么差这么多？今天我们就看清：这个旋钮到底在系统",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 2,
     "startSeconds": 35.23,
     "endSeconds": 47.96,
     "textPreview": "先看没有反馈时，增益能做什么。对象 G0 等于 s 乘 s 加 4 分之一，前面",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 3,
     "startSeconds": 47.96,
     "endSeconds": 56.6,
     "textPreview": "开环极点固定在 0 和 −4，K 改不动它们。现在加上单位负反馈。",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 4,
     "startSeconds": 56.6,
     "endSeconds": 67.6,
     "textPreview": "误差是期望减输出，输出是误差乘 K 再乘对象。消去误差，闭环传递函数等于 KG0",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:v11g-69118dc66489d66b1732901b",
       "matchedLabel": "闭环传递函数",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 5,
     "startSeconds": 67.6,
     "endSeconds": 76.62,
     "textPreview": "代入对象，分母变成 s 方加 4s 加 K。看出区别了吗？开环里 K 是乘数，只",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 6,
     "startSeconds": 76.62,
     "endSeconds": 88.98,
     "textPreview": "闭环里 K 进了特征方程，成了系数。每换一个 K，极点就跟着搬一次家。既然 K ",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:v11g-40ac1517fc1bfb398dd75afe",
       "matchedLabel": "特征方程",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 32,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 7,
     "startSeconds": 88.98,
     "endSeconds": 101.83,
     "textPreview": "s 等于 −2 加减根号下 4 减 K。K 很小时，两个极点在实轴上，一个从 −",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 8,
     "startSeconds": 102.25,
     "endSeconds": 111.59,
     "textPreview": "K 等于 4，两个极点在 −2 会合——这是临界阻尼。K 再大，极点离开实轴，变",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-6bb580c242f908566ab53b18",
       "matchedLabel": "临界阻尼",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 9,
     "startSeconds": 111.59,
     "endSeconds": 123.1,
     "textPreview": "实部停在 −2，衰减包络不再加速；虚部一直涨，摆动越来越密，超调出现了。注意，全",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 10,
     "startSeconds": 125.1,
     "endSeconds": 136.22,
     "textPreview": "极点预判完了，把三条完整响应曲线请出来验证。K 等于 1，两个实极点，单调慢收，",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 11,
     "startSeconds": 136.22,
     "endSeconds": 148.78,
     "textPreview": "K 等于 4，重极点——不产生超调的最快响应，约 2.4 秒。K 等于 8，共轭",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 12,
     "startSeconds": 149.2,
     "endSeconds": 167.42,
     "textPreview": "用 4% 出头的超调，换十倍的提速——这就是调参的交换。同样的三种脾气，在弹簧阻",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:v11g-5845390ded447e37f06ea222",
       "matchedLabel": "根轨迹",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 13,
     "startSeconds": 167.84,
     "endSeconds": 176.29,
     "textPreview": "起点告诉你零增益时系统在哪，方向告诉你参数增大时往哪走，会合点告诉你行为在哪里发",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 14,
     "startSeconds": 176.29,
     "endSeconds": 187.04,
     "textPreview": "现在不用记绘制规则，会先读这张地图就够了。回到自动舵。同一艘船，三个工作点，三份",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 15,
     "startSeconds": 187.04,
     "endSeconds": 200.13,
     "textPreview": "保守、临界、少量超调——各有适用场景。但继续拧大 K，实部永远停在 −2，衰减不",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 16,
     "startSeconds": 200.13,
     "endSeconds": 212.37,
     "textPreview": "想突破它，就得改控制器的结构，那是模块三和四的任务。这一讲的核心动作只有一步：把",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 17,
     "startSeconds": 212.37,
     "endSeconds": 221.03,
     "textPreview": "从此增益成了结构变量，极点被它推着走，根轨迹就是这条参数、极点、行为之链的可视化",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:v11g-5845390ded447e37f06ea222",
       "matchedLabel": "根轨迹",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 18,
     "startSeconds": 221.03,
     "endSeconds": 226.09,
     "textPreview": "留个悬念：旋钮换成积分或微分，极点还会这样走吗？",
     "canonical": []
    }
   ],
   "activeReleaseSha256": "29ec09654dae4041c8840349191d8d0876b5622ff9ce2b8aefbdd1a4975db637",
